{"3831210": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Lawn Mowing Simulator 2", "steam_appid": 3831210, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "dlc": [4787720], "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3831210/extras/25b84e14560b35222d14b426e0748886.avif?t=1788270611\" width=1024 height=328 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Prepare your mower and blower, and get ready to head to the heartland of mowing... Lawn Mowing Simulator 2 is heading to the USA to start a whole new career in the world of lawncare!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Lawn Mowing Simulator 2 (LMS2)</strong> is the sequel to Lawn Mowing Simulator, which builds on the rewarding working-sim feel of the original. Listening to community feedback, and internal reflections, <strong>LMS2</strong> will offer an expanded take on professional lawn care and use real-world equipment from manufacturer partners <i><strong>Kubota</strong></i><strong>, <i>SCAGⓇ</i> and <i>STIGA</i>!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3831210/extras/23009e68820232ad60cb23e266152974.poster.avif?t=1788270611\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3831210/extras/23009e68820232ad60cb23e266152974.webm?t=1788270611\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3831210/extras/23009e68820232ad60cb23e266152974.mp4?t=1788270611\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The <strong>brand new USA setting</strong> and completely new grass tech will allow players to get the best cut ever, as you'll see from these comparison shots between LMS and LMS2!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3831210/extras/997d0cb9e513bde946c87ed35042557e.poster.avif?t=1788270611\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3831210/extras/997d0cb9e513bde946c87ed35042557e.webm?t=1788270611\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3831210/extras/997d0cb9e513bde946c87ed35042557e.mp4?t=1788270611\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3831210/extras/cd85da57895204aa1d199f2568d75b58.poster.avif?t=1788270611\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3831210/extras/cd85da57895204aa1d199f2568d75b58.webm?t=1788270611\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3831210/extras/cd85da57895204aa1d199f2568d75b58.mp4?t=1788270611\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Not only that, but new mowers and string trimmers will be included, as well as much requested <strong>leaf blowers</strong>!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3831210/extras/e164e575bf009c5d3e6410f496374414.poster.avif?t=1788270611\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3831210/extras/e164e575bf009c5d3e6410f496374414.webm?t=1788270611\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3831210/extras/e164e575bf009c5d3e6410f496374414.mp4?t=1788270611\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Career mode gets a total overhaul for all you management fans with a 3D fully explorable HQ from which to run your business, as well as enhanced character customisation.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3831210/extras/e80c136992294845dd18917765edc384.poster.avif?t=1788270611\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3831210/extras/e80c136992294845dd18917765edc384.webm?t=1788270611\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3831210/extras/e80c136992294845dd18917765edc384.mp4?t=1788270611\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3831210/extras/fe819e0f85b00f68454d6641374a368a.avif?t=1788270611\" width=700 height=100 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>LMS2</strong> will feature a new <strong>USA setting</strong>, with brand new locations and a wide range of jobs for players to take. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3831210/extras/a4b14afae1bcf9dd0bb5a673fc349325.avif?t=1788270611\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3831210/extras_big/a4b14afae1bcf9dd0bb5a673fc349325.avif?t=1788270611 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >From suburban lawns to commercial and municipal locations, LMS2 will feature 11 locations (more than LMS1 did at launch). Most of these locations will have multiple contracts of varying size and theme - while the addition of new tasks like leaf blowing and weed clearance means that there will be more to do than just cutting the grass in every location.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3831210/extras/c25d6fdce335e661029f2fff58f763b2.avif?t=1788270611\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3831210/extras_big/c25d6fdce335e661029f2fff58f763b2.avif?t=1788270611 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3831210/extras/95fa8b36b78784358c462653a3cdea3e.avif?t=1788270611\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3831210/extras_big/95fa8b36b78784358c462653a3cdea3e.avif?t=1788270611 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We love that some of you out there have racked up amazing numbers of hours  playing the first LMS (some more than 1,000!) - and we hope you will in LMS2 as well. So to help those hours of mowing gameplay continuing to feel fresh, we have developed a system where gardens can change over time with new features that change how you approach completing them.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3831210/extras/d115e9064d7659c0ffd1ba90b9da0ccc.poster.avif?t=1788270611\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3831210/extras/d115e9064d7659c0ffd1ba90b9da0ccc.webm?t=1788270611\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3831210/extras/d115e9064d7659c0ffd1ba90b9da0ccc.mp4?t=1788270611\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >One visit to a house might see it have a new series of flower beds added, then the next time an above ground pool or flagpole has appeared. This ensures that while you'll want to keep your loyal customers happy, not every visit to the same location is identical each time.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3831210/extras/38f45d236ca2a7d3473c570043f114ef.avif?t=1788270611\" width=700 height=100 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We know these have been wanted for a long time, and in <strong>LMS2</strong> we have <strong>leaf blowers</strong> as a part of the core game for clearing up leaves, as well as grass clippings.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3831210/extras/e164e575bf009c5d3e6410f496374414.poster.avif?t=1788270611\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3831210/extras/e164e575bf009c5d3e6410f496374414.webm?t=1788270611\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3831210/extras/e164e575bf009c5d3e6410f496374414.mp4?t=1788270611\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But leaf blowers wouldn’t be much fun without a lot of leaves to blast! So we've rebuilt the game up to be capable of a lot of grass... and a lot of leaves! In fact, in <strong>LMS2,</strong> tens of thousands of leaves can be blown around at once.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3831210/extras/bfa426ddae6c55bc3c0d3cbf70bb5819.avif?t=1788270611\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3831210/extras_big/bfa426ddae6c55bc3c0d3cbf70bb5819.avif?t=1788270611 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And as you blow the leaves onto your tarpaulin they'll be collected until it's full. Then it's time to pick up the tarp, empty it into a debris bag, and you're ready to go again until all those leaves are cleared up!<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3831210/extras/251fe103fde27f7bf3591cd67d563deb.avif?t=1788270611\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3831210/extras_big/251fe103fde27f7bf3591cd67d563deb.avif?t=1788270611 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You won’t only have a leaf blower to get the job done! <strong>LMS2</strong> will also give the player a trusty <strong>rake</strong> to help get leaves out of those hard-to-reach places.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3831210/extras/ff73780268403d37c9d1bed511724672.poster.avif?t=1788270611\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3831210/extras/ff73780268403d37c9d1bed511724672.webm?t=1788270611\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3831210/extras/ff73780268403d37c9d1bed511724672.mp4?t=1788270611\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3831210/extras/4aa0d30a342c4469b66ea381690e4b92.avif?t=1788270611\" width=700 height=100 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A new line up of mowers and string trimmers will be available in <strong>LMS2</strong>, as well as the new addition of leaf blowers, with each one being meticulously recreated in game to be as accurate as possible. We’ve created this handy comparison to show how LMS2 at launch will compare with the original game when it released: <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3831210/extras/46cff8dc42fb598b9371556d3f92f260.avif?t=1788270611\" width=1560 height=1015 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As you can see, <strong>LMS2 </strong>will feature <strong>more equipment</strong> than its predecessor, and we have great plans for even more additions to the line-up post-release - just like the original game!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But what are the mowers, string trimmers and leaf blowers? Well, here are the details! We’re delighted that <strong>Kubota</strong>, <strong>SCAG®</strong> and <strong>STIGA</strong> have all signed up to be a part of <strong>LMS2</strong>, while we will also be bringing back our own in-house brands Patterson and Knight as well.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3831210/extras/f42eeff48760fe02d7233b5498ca1420.avif?t=1788270611\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3831210/extras_big/f42eeff48760fe02d7233b5498ca1420.webp?t=1788270611 width=1560 height=1015 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3831210/extras/1d61a08f39fd83cbe6d526b0d65869b1.poster.avif?t=1788270611\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3831210/extras/1d61a08f39fd83cbe6d526b0d65869b1.webm?t=1788270611\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3831210/extras/1d61a08f39fd83cbe6d526b0d65869b1.mp4?t=1788270611\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3831210/extras/56c752d880997bddcfe315cfb5ca95c5.poster.avif?t=1788270611\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3831210/extras/56c752d880997bddcfe315cfb5ca95c5.webm?t=1788270611\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3831210/extras/56c752d880997bddcfe315cfb5ca95c5.mp4?t=1788270611\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3831210/extras/d37b4da546e159d277a57155170f0cc6.poster.avif?t=1788270611\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3831210/extras/d37b4da546e159d277a57155170f0cc6.webm?t=1788270611\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3831210/extras/d37b4da546e159d277a57155170f0cc6.mp4?t=1788270611\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3831210/extras/00d95cd86edf6251d107ea561d9cccf8.avif?t=1788270611\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3831210/extras_big/00d95cd86edf6251d107ea561d9cccf8.avif?t=1788270611 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3831210/extras/1ab57092a501a42da84539e21a22e5c0.avif?t=1788270611\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3831210/extras_big/1ab57092a501a42da84539e21a22e5c0.avif?t=1788270611 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3831210/extras/3e882ba1cf65c2a9ac9034533d17a76a.avif?t=1788270611\" width=700 height=100 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We have invested a lot of development time in building a <strong>new grass system</strong> from scratch. This was one of the most important elements that we wanted to improve from the original game and you'll really be able to see at-a-glance the difference between cut and uncut grass.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3831210/extras/c5b09d005a3e3419c3353435dfd9773c.avif?t=1788270611\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3831210/extras_big/c5b09d005a3e3419c3353435dfd9773c.avif?t=1788270611 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3831210/extras/daa6930896416324361078cfdad464bc.avif?t=1788270611\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This makes a huge difference to the satisfaction of your gameplay, <strong>flowers</strong> and <strong>weeds</strong> will now become a part of the lawn's make up, as well as much more variation in the uncut lawns grass heights, which will really highlight your efforts as a player to make an overgrown lawn look perfect.</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3831210/extras/25b84e14560b35222d14b426e0748886.avif?t=1788270611\" width=1024 height=328 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Prepare your mower and blower, and get ready to head to the heartland of mowing... Lawn Mowing Simulator 2 is heading to the USA to start a whole new career in the world of lawncare!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Lawn Mowing Simulator 2 (LMS2)</strong> is the sequel to Lawn Mowing Simulator, which builds on the rewarding working-sim feel of the original. Listening to community feedback, and internal reflections, <strong>LMS2</strong> will offer an expanded take on professional lawn care and use real-world equipment from manufacturer partners <i><strong>Kubota</strong></i><strong>, <i>SCAGⓇ</i> and <i>STIGA</i>!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3831210/extras/23009e68820232ad60cb23e266152974.poster.avif?t=1788270611\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3831210/extras/23009e68820232ad60cb23e266152974.webm?t=1788270611\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3831210/extras/23009e68820232ad60cb23e266152974.mp4?t=1788270611\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The <strong>brand new USA setting</strong> and completely new grass tech will allow players to get the best cut ever, as you'll see from these comparison shots between LMS and LMS2!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3831210/extras/997d0cb9e513bde946c87ed35042557e.poster.avif?t=1788270611\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3831210/extras/997d0cb9e513bde946c87ed35042557e.webm?t=1788270611\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3831210/extras/997d0cb9e513bde946c87ed35042557e.mp4?t=1788270611\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3831210/extras/cd85da57895204aa1d199f2568d75b58.poster.avif?t=1788270611\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3831210/extras/cd85da57895204aa1d199f2568d75b58.webm?t=1788270611\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3831210/extras/cd85da57895204aa1d199f2568d75b58.mp4?t=1788270611\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Not only that, but new mowers and string trimmers will be included, as well as much requested <strong>leaf blowers</strong>!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3831210/extras/e164e575bf009c5d3e6410f496374414.poster.avif?t=1788270611\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3831210/extras/e164e575bf009c5d3e6410f496374414.webm?t=1788270611\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3831210/extras/e164e575bf009c5d3e6410f496374414.mp4?t=1788270611\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Career mode gets a total overhaul for all you management fans with a 3D fully explorable HQ from which to run your business, as well as enhanced character customisation.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3831210/extras/e80c136992294845dd18917765edc384.poster.avif?t=1788270611\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3831210/extras/e80c136992294845dd18917765edc384.webm?t=1788270611\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3831210/extras/e80c136992294845dd18917765edc384.mp4?t=1788270611\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3831210/extras/fe819e0f85b00f68454d6641374a368a.avif?t=1788270611\" width=700 height=100 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>LMS2</strong> will feature a new <strong>USA setting</strong>, with brand new locations and a wide range of jobs for players to take. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3831210/extras/a4b14afae1bcf9dd0bb5a673fc349325.avif?t=1788270611\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3831210/extras_big/a4b14afae1bcf9dd0bb5a673fc349325.avif?t=1788270611 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >From suburban lawns to commercial and municipal locations, LMS2 will feature 11 locations (more than LMS1 did at launch). Most of these locations will have multiple contracts of varying size and theme - while the addition of new tasks like leaf blowing and weed clearance means that there will be more to do than just cutting the grass in every location.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3831210/extras/c25d6fdce335e661029f2fff58f763b2.avif?t=1788270611\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3831210/extras_big/c25d6fdce335e661029f2fff58f763b2.avif?t=1788270611 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3831210/extras/95fa8b36b78784358c462653a3cdea3e.avif?t=1788270611\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3831210/extras_big/95fa8b36b78784358c462653a3cdea3e.avif?t=1788270611 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We love that some of you out there have racked up amazing numbers of hours  playing the first LMS (some more than 1,000!) - and we hope you will in LMS2 as well. So to help those hours of mowing gameplay continuing to feel fresh, we have developed a system where gardens can change over time with new features that change how you approach completing them.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3831210/extras/d115e9064d7659c0ffd1ba90b9da0ccc.poster.avif?t=1788270611\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3831210/extras/d115e9064d7659c0ffd1ba90b9da0ccc.webm?t=1788270611\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3831210/extras/d115e9064d7659c0ffd1ba90b9da0ccc.mp4?t=1788270611\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >One visit to a house might see it have a new series of flower beds added, then the next time an above ground pool or flagpole has appeared. This ensures that while you'll want to keep your loyal customers happy, not every visit to the same location is identical each time.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3831210/extras/38f45d236ca2a7d3473c570043f114ef.avif?t=1788270611\" width=700 height=100 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We know these have been wanted for a long time, and in <strong>LMS2</strong> we have <strong>leaf blowers</strong> as a part of the core game for clearing up leaves, as well as grass clippings.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3831210/extras/e164e575bf009c5d3e6410f496374414.poster.avif?t=1788270611\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3831210/extras/e164e575bf009c5d3e6410f496374414.webm?t=1788270611\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3831210/extras/e164e575bf009c5d3e6410f496374414.mp4?t=1788270611\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But leaf blowers wouldn’t be much fun without a lot of leaves to blast! So we've rebuilt the game up to be capable of a lot of grass... and a lot of leaves! In fact, in <strong>LMS2,</strong> tens of thousands of leaves can be blown around at once.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3831210/extras/bfa426ddae6c55bc3c0d3cbf70bb5819.avif?t=1788270611\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3831210/extras_big/bfa426ddae6c55bc3c0d3cbf70bb5819.avif?t=1788270611 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And as you blow the leaves onto your tarpaulin they'll be collected until it's full. Then it's time to pick up the tarp, empty it into a debris bag, and you're ready to go again until all those leaves are cleared up!<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3831210/extras/251fe103fde27f7bf3591cd67d563deb.avif?t=1788270611\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3831210/extras_big/251fe103fde27f7bf3591cd67d563deb.avif?t=1788270611 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You won’t only have a leaf blower to get the job done! <strong>LMS2</strong> will also give the player a trusty <strong>rake</strong> to help get leaves out of those hard-to-reach places.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3831210/extras/ff73780268403d37c9d1bed511724672.poster.avif?t=1788270611\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3831210/extras/ff73780268403d37c9d1bed511724672.webm?t=1788270611\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3831210/extras/ff73780268403d37c9d1bed511724672.mp4?t=1788270611\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3831210/extras/4aa0d30a342c4469b66ea381690e4b92.avif?t=1788270611\" width=700 height=100 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A new line up of mowers and string trimmers will be available in <strong>LMS2</strong>, as well as the new addition of leaf blowers, with each one being meticulously recreated in game to be as accurate as possible. We’ve created this handy comparison to show how LMS2 at launch will compare with the original game when it released: <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3831210/extras/46cff8dc42fb598b9371556d3f92f260.avif?t=1788270611\" width=1560 height=1015 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As you can see, <strong>LMS2 </strong>will feature <strong>more equipment</strong> than its predecessor, and we have great plans for even more additions to the line-up post-release - just like the original game!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But what are the mowers, string trimmers and leaf blowers? Well, here are the details! We’re delighted that <strong>Kubota</strong>, <strong>SCAG®</strong> and <strong>STIGA</strong> have all signed up to be a part of <strong>LMS2</strong>, while we will also be bringing back our own in-house brands Patterson and Knight as well.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3831210/extras/f42eeff48760fe02d7233b5498ca1420.avif?t=1788270611\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3831210/extras_big/f42eeff48760fe02d7233b5498ca1420.webp?t=1788270611 width=1560 height=1015 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3831210/extras/1d61a08f39fd83cbe6d526b0d65869b1.poster.avif?t=1788270611\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3831210/extras/1d61a08f39fd83cbe6d526b0d65869b1.webm?t=1788270611\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3831210/extras/1d61a08f39fd83cbe6d526b0d65869b1.mp4?t=1788270611\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3831210/extras/56c752d880997bddcfe315cfb5ca95c5.poster.avif?t=1788270611\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3831210/extras/56c752d880997bddcfe315cfb5ca95c5.webm?t=1788270611\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3831210/extras/56c752d880997bddcfe315cfb5ca95c5.mp4?t=1788270611\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3831210/extras/d37b4da546e159d277a57155170f0cc6.poster.avif?t=1788270611\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3831210/extras/d37b4da546e159d277a57155170f0cc6.webm?t=1788270611\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3831210/extras/d37b4da546e159d277a57155170f0cc6.mp4?t=1788270611\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3831210/extras/00d95cd86edf6251d107ea561d9cccf8.avif?t=1788270611\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3831210/extras_big/00d95cd86edf6251d107ea561d9cccf8.avif?t=1788270611 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3831210/extras/1ab57092a501a42da84539e21a22e5c0.avif?t=1788270611\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3831210/extras_big/1ab57092a501a42da84539e21a22e5c0.avif?t=1788270611 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3831210/extras/3e882ba1cf65c2a9ac9034533d17a76a.avif?t=1788270611\" width=700 height=100 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We have invested a lot of development time in building a <strong>new grass system</strong> from scratch. This was one of the most important elements that we wanted to improve from the original game and you'll really be able to see at-a-glance the difference between cut and uncut grass.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3831210/extras/c5b09d005a3e3419c3353435dfd9773c.avif?t=1788270611\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3831210/extras_big/c5b09d005a3e3419c3353435dfd9773c.avif?t=1788270611 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3831210/extras/daa6930896416324361078cfdad464bc.avif?t=1788270611\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This makes a huge difference to the satisfaction of your gameplay, <strong>flowers</strong> and <strong>weeds</strong> will now become a part of the lawn's make up, as well as much more variation in the uncut lawns grass heights, which will really highlight your efforts as a player to make an overgrown lawn look perfect.</p>", "short_description": "Head to the USA and grow your own business with a realistic and relaxing lawn mowing experience! Featuring brand new grass tech, the addition of leaf-blowing plus reworked systems based on player feedback to the original - including licensed equipment from Kubota, STIGA and SCAGⓇ!", "supported_languages": "English, French, German, Spanish - Spain, Simplified Chinese, Italian", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3831210/bb26cc5b2cba775ed57f415a537822d84144fa66/header.jpg?t=1788270611", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3831210/ece93c70aec7a01ee8cf721bd2593d4a2a8b69c4/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1788270611", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3831210/ece93c70aec7a01ee8cf721bd2593d4a2a8b69c4/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1788270611", "website": "https://skyhookgames.com/", "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10/11 64bit<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i5-6400, AMD Ryzen 5 1400, or better<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Nvidia GeForce GTX 1050Ti, AMD Radeon RX 470 graphics card or better (min 3GB VRAM, DX12 support)<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 12<br></li><li><strong>Network:</strong> Broadband Internet connection<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 45 GB available space<br></li><li><strong>Sound Card:</strong> Sound card<br></li><li><strong>VR Support:</strong> -<br></li><li><strong>Additional Notes:</strong> Actual performance may vary based on overall system configuration, but should run at 30 FPS+ @ Low 1080p</li></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10/11 64bit<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i7-10700, AMD Ryzen 7 3800X, or better<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 12 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Nvidia GeForce RTX 2070, AMD Radeon RX 5700 XT, Intel